{"suttaId":"tha-ap321","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[9385,9406],"vripara":"47"},"segments":{"tha-ap321:0.3":"Kandalipupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap321:1.1":"“Sindhuyā nadiyā tīre, ahosiṃ kassako tadā;","tha-ap321:1.3":"Parakammāyane yutto, parabhattaṃ apassito.","tha-ap321:2.1":"“Sindhuṃ anucarantohaṃ, siddhatthaṃ jinamaddasaṃ;","tha-ap321:2.3":"Samādhinā nisinnaṃva, satapattaṃva pupphitaṃ.","tha-ap321:3.1":"“Satta kandalipupphāni, vaṇṭe chetvānahaṃ tadā;","tha-ap321:3.3":"Matthake abhiropesiṃ, buddhassādiccabandhuno.","tha-ap321:4.1":"“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ, anukūle samāhitaṃ;","tha-ap321:4.3":"Tidhāpabhinnamātaṅgaṃ, kuñjaraṃva durāsadaṃ.","tha-ap321:5.1":"“Tamahaṃ upagantvāna, nipakaṃ bhāvitindriyaṃ;","tha-ap321:5.3":"Añjaliṃ paggahetvāna, avandiṃ satthuno ahaṃ.","tha-ap321:6.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap321:6.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap321:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap321:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā kandalipupphiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap321:9.1":"Kandalipupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
